[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早饭，看到餐桌上的盘子后我不禁停下了脚步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“居然……不是炒饭!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“眼睛，瞎了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不不，这怎么看都是蛋包饭吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15387"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“是炒饭哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“是用番茄酱调味，然后用鸡蛋卷起来的炒饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15401"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哼哼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？为什么一副很了不起的样子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15538"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“因为炒饭是万能的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“算了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你说什么就是什么吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老老实实地开始吃炒饭（蛋包饭）。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嚓……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"隐藏佐料是蛋壳（钙质）呢……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15499"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“炒饭是～万能的～”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15455"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“吖唔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嚓……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未也开始补钙了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊，对了对了，羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11635"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“关于之前那本书。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……书？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15591"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……色色的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉؟!被发现了؟!我明明藏得那么深？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不是那个，是之前在仓库里和标本一起的古书。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，是那本啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我正在翻译成现代文，大概今天就能完成。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的吗！谢谢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍对这本记载了七影蝶相关信息的古书也很感兴趣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她现在所做的事，如果我能帮上点忙就好了。"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]